{
  "title": "{im:Mirava} a convincerli, onde evitare lo scontro",
  "translation": "He aimed to convince them, so as to avoid a clash",
  "topics": "Fine distinctions among conjunctions, prepositions and verb patterns",
  "grammar": {
    "explain": [
      {
        "h": "Choosing among close conjunctions"
      },
      "Conjunctions that seem interchangeable differ in logic, register or the mood that follows.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Relation",
            "Everyday",
            "Formal",
            "Mood"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Cause",
              "perché, siccome",
              "giacché, poiché, in quanto",
              "indicative"
            ],
            [
              "Purpose",
              "per, perché",
              "affinché, onde + infinitive",
              "congiuntivo, or infinitive"
            ],
            [
              "Time",
              "quando",
              "allorché, allorquando",
              "indicative"
            ],
            [
              "Concession",
              "anche se",
              "ancorché, sebbene, quantunque",
              "congiuntivo (not anche se)"
            ],
            [
              "Condition",
              "se",
              "qualora, ove, purché",
              "congiuntivo (not se + real)"
            ],
            [
              "Contrast",
              "mentre",
              "laddove, invece che",
              "indicative"
            ],
            [
              "Extent",
              "come",
              "nella misura in cui",
              "indicative"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "*Giacché* presents the cause as already known, while *perché* introduces it as new information. So *Giacché ci {ip:sei}, {imv:aiutami}* is natural, because you are obviously here.",
      {
        "h": "Expressions that structure an argument"
      },
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Expression",
            "Function",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "fermo restando che",
              "keeping something fixed",
              "Fermo restando che il budget non {ip:cambia}, …"
            ],
            [
              "a prescindere da",
              "excluding a factor",
              "A prescindere dal costo, {ip:è} un errore."
            ],
            [
              "alla luce di",
              "considering",
              "Alla luce dei dati, …"
            ],
            [
              "in virtù di",
              "by reason of",
              "In virtù dell'accordo, …"
            ],
            [
              "onde evitare",
              "so as to avoid",
              "Onde evitare equivoci, ribadisco…"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "h": "Verbs that look alike"
      },
      "Close synonyms can require different constructions.",
